SUMMARY:Beyond Networking: Creating Meaningful Connections In Your Community
DESCRIPTION:Presented by Career Ready Lancaster! & Next Generation Lancaster\, don’t miss this evening of meaningful networking and leadership insight featuring keynote speaker Mike Reynolds\, CEO of the Lancaster Stormers. Learn how authentic connections can open doors\, strengthen communities\, and help you lead with impact — all in the newly remodeled Plain and Fancy Restaurant in Bird in Hand\, PA. Enjoy light refreshments and drinks while connecting with professionals and community leaders from across Lancaster County. Come for the conversation\, leave with connections that matter. \n\n\n\n\n    Register Now
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/beyond-networking-creating-meaningful-connections-in-your-community/
LOCATION:Plain & Fancy Restaurant\, 3121 Old Philadelphia Pike\, Bird in Hand\, PA\, 17505\, United States
CATEGORIES:Community
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://fig.guide/content/uploads/sites/3/2026/07/Next-Gen-x-CRL-Flyer.avif
ORGANIZER;CN="Next Generation of Lancaster%2C PA":MAILTO:ej.pratt522@gmail.com
END:VEVENT
