DESCRIPTION:Immerse yourself in the thrill of live competition as talented artists race against the clock\, transforming blank canvases into finished paintings in just 20 minutes. With every bold stroke\, you’ll watch the creative process unfold in real time.\n\nYour votes determine which artists move on to the final round and who is crowned the champion of the night.\n\nDoors open at 6:30PM\, paiting starts at 7:00PM\n\nEvery painting created during the event goes up for live auction\, giving you the opportunity to take home original artwork created right before your eyes. \n\n\n\n\n    Buy Tickets
